# Voldaren Epicure is Bolted with its enters trigger on the stack. The trigger resolves anyway: the damage is dealt by
# the creature as it last existed (CR 113.7a, 608.2h), so Bot2 still takes 1, and Bot1 still creates its Blood token.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Voldaren Epicure
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Voldaren Epicure.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Voldaren Epicure)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
? Stack.Count = 2
? Bot2.Life = 20
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

